WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 3=

01:59.540 --> 02:00.020
Your Highness.

02:01.050 --> 02:01.660
Are you all right?

02:02.460 --> 02:03.180
Are you hurt?

02:08.010 --> 02:09.130
What took you so long?

02:10.220 --> 02:10.660
You're right.

02:11.730 --> 02:12.450
I got here too late.

02:14.610 --> 02:15.540
I'll get you out of here now.

02:19.690 --> 02:20.170
You...

02:21.100 --> 02:22.450
You didn't even bring a torch.

02:23.290 --> 02:24.850
You really aren't afraid to die,
are you?

03:04.890 --> 03:06.060
It's so cold.

03:08.130 --> 03:09.940
Aren't we in Lingnan?

03:12.290 --> 03:13.450
You've lost too much blood.

03:14.980 --> 03:15.660
Hang in there a little longer.

03:16.610 --> 03:17.450
Yan Shang.

03:18.500 --> 03:19.890
I never thought

03:21.130 --> 03:22.450
you'd find me.

03:22.690 --> 03:23.450
Actually,

03:24.940 --> 03:26.220
I never thought

03:27.380 --> 03:29.780
anyone would find me.

03:31.060 --> 03:31.730
You're a princess.

03:32.130 --> 03:32.850
You're of high status.

03:33.780 --> 03:34.450
If you're ever in danger,

03:35.060 --> 03:36.260
everyone will come looking for you.

03:36.780 --> 03:37.890
You're lying.

03:39.170 --> 03:40.060
I've always...

03:41.060 --> 03:41.890
always...

03:44.010 --> 03:45.450
been alone.

03:47.010 --> 03:47.730
No matter

03:49.130 --> 03:50.380
how much danger I was in,

03:51.980 --> 03:54.060
no matter how hard things got,

03:56.010 --> 03:56.940
there was never

03:58.540 --> 04:00.940
anyone there to help me.

04:04.060 --> 04:05.500
No one ever asked

04:06.500 --> 04:07.340
if I was all right,

04:08.850 --> 04:10.940
or if I was hurt.

04:13.340 --> 04:14.010
It's going to be okay.

04:17.610 --> 04:18.780
I'm so cold.

04:23.000 --> 04:28.590
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

04:31.160 --> 04:36.350
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

04:37.080 --> 04:38.480
♪Even when we're covered in mud♪

04:41.140 --> 04:42.170
Yan Shang.

04:44.410 --> 04:46.019
You're so warm.

04:46.061 --> 04:47.550
♪Together we'll plunge into karmic fire♪

04:47.600 --> 04:49.380
♪Burning bright as a song♪

04:50.700 --> 04:51.290
Don't fall asleep.

04:51.900 --> 04:52.540
Let's talk.

04:53.440 --> 04:56.760
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

04:56.900 --> 04:57.460
No.

04:58.100 --> 05:00.250
Hardly a word you say is true.

05:01.980 --> 05:02.780
No lies this time.

05:03.580 --> 05:04.410
Ask me anything.

05:07.170 --> 05:08.100
Yan Shang.

05:09.660 --> 05:10.410
Which character

05:11.780 --> 05:13.780
is "Shang" in your name?

05:15.220 --> 05:15.930
Shang, as in "Shangshu".

05:17.020 --> 05:17.900
My father gave me that name.

05:18.610 --> 05:20.810
Why that character?

05:21.730 --> 05:23.370
"I revere the legacy of former worthies,

05:23.900 --> 05:25.050
I grieve that I was born too late
to meet them."

05:25.930 --> 05:26.810
It means to admire.

05:27.700 --> 05:28.979
And also to protect.

05:29.021 --> 05:31.880
♪No panic, fear, hate, or pain.
Smoke fades, leaves fall, flowers bloom♪

05:31.880 --> 05:34.220
♪You're the only one I need♪

05:35.140 --> 05:36.170
That's great.

05:40.140 --> 05:41.660
My name is Wanyao.

05:41.760 --> 05:43.480
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

05:43.530 --> 05:44.730
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

05:44.780 --> 05:47.660
My father gave me this name too.

05:52.460 --> 05:54.850
The sun is setting,
and the road is long.

05:56.140 --> 05:57.250
Tossed about by wind and rain.

05:59.050 --> 06:00.100
That's what my name means.

06:04.400 --> 06:08.630
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

06:11.120 --> 06:16.110
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

06:16.500 --> 06:18.740
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

06:18.790 --> 06:20.870
♪Together we'll turn to ashes♪

06:20.920 --> 06:22.569
♪Burning bright as a song♪

06:22.611 --> 06:26.060
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

06:26.410 --> 06:31.510
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

06:31.510 --> 06:33.560
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

06:34.410 --> 06:34.850
Your Highness!

06:36.660 --> 06:37.050
Your Highness!

06:37.490 --> 06:37.900
I'm sorry!

06:38.220 --> 06:38.700
Are you all right?

06:41.810 --> 06:43.170
You're utterly useless.

06:44.930 --> 06:45.490
The rain's too heavy.

06:45.930 --> 06:46.980
We need to find shelter.

06:48.140 --> 06:48.610
I'll carry you.

06:49.510 --> 06:53.150
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

06:53.260 --> 06:59.830
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

07:02.120 --> 07:07.720
(My lady! My lady!)

07:08.040 --> 07:10.400
♪No matter how fiercely the winds
may cut♪

07:10.720 --> 07:12.320
(My lady! My lady!)

07:12.960 --> 07:15.400
(My lady! My lady!)

07:16.400 --> 07:17.950
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

07:18.020 --> 07:21.540
(My lady! My lady! My lady!)

08:01.170 --> 08:01.810
You're hurt.

08:02.580 --> 08:03.580
I need to remove the bandage

08:04.100 --> 08:04.900
and check your wound.

08:07.140 --> 08:07.730
Go ahead.

08:08.660 --> 08:09.340
You have my permission.

08:32.010 --> 08:32.820
This wound...

08:35.370 --> 08:36.180
I cut it myself.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.370
I did it to let some blood out.

08:37.610 --> 08:38.370
You were bitten by a snake?

08:42.820 --> 08:44.130
Am I going to die?

08:45.370 --> 08:46.130
If I die...

08:46.890 --> 08:48.180
Then could I be reunited with them

08:49.100 --> 08:50.890
in the underworld?

08:54.180 --> 08:55.250
Today,

08:56.530 --> 08:57.700
I saw her.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.300
When was that?

09:00.700 --> 09:01.730
When I was little.

09:05.340 --> 09:06.060
I meant,

09:06.610 --> 09:07.530
when did the snake bite you?

09:11.530 --> 09:12.730
More than half a day ago.

09:16.730 --> 09:17.730
You've survived this long.

09:18.770 --> 09:19.610
You should be all right.

09:22.340 --> 09:23.010
I see.

09:52.850 --> 09:53.650
I need to examine you further.

09:54.420 --> 09:54.940
Forgive me.

11:09.820 --> 11:10.730
Get some rest.

11:11.700 --> 11:12.580
I'll stay here and watch over you.

11:31.010 --> 11:31.890
(She's running a fever.)

11:54.250 --> 11:54.580
Don't...

11:55.010 --> 11:55.460
Don't...

11:56.180 --> 11:56.940
Don't kill me!

11:57.650 --> 11:58.250
Don't kill me!

12:07.730 --> 12:08.370
Don't kill me!

12:08.980 --> 12:09.770
Don't kill me!

12:12.340 --> 12:12.770
What's wrong?

12:13.460 --> 12:14.130
Don't kill me!

12:14.850 --> 12:15.399
Don't kill me!

12:15.441 --> 12:15.850
Your Highness!

12:16.580 --> 12:18.180
We're safe in the cave. Don't be afraid.

12:18.850 --> 12:19.890
I'll kill you all!

12:20.420 --> 12:21.460
I'll kill you all!

12:25.250 --> 12:26.130
I'll kill you all!

12:26.610 --> 12:26.980
Don't be afraid.

12:27.220 --> 12:27.610
It's all right.

12:31.730 --> 12:32.370
You're safe.

12:53.980 --> 12:54.370
Your Highness.

12:54.820 --> 12:55.460
Don't listen to the thunder.

12:55.850 --> 12:56.650
Just listen to my voice.

12:59.010 --> 12:59.820
This is Lingnan.

13:00.610 --> 13:01.940
Violent storms never last long.

13:02.820 --> 13:03.820
Once we weather the storm, it will pass.

13:06.580 --> 13:07.010
It's all right.

13:08.060 --> 13:08.530
It's all right.

13:09.700 --> 13:10.060
It's okay.

13:25.420 --> 13:25.980
It's okay.

14:32.220 --> 14:33.100
(My lady!)

14:33.730 --> 14:36.679
(My lady! My lady!)

14:36.721 --> 14:37.370
(Search carefully!)

14:40.180 --> 14:44.460
(My lady! My lady!)

14:49.180 --> 14:50.250
Her fever's gone down.

14:50.940 --> 14:51.850
(My lady!)

14:51.980 --> 14:53.060
(My lady!)

14:54.180 --> 14:54.890
(Everyone, search carefully!)

14:55.370 --> 14:56.229
(My lady!)

14:56.271 --> 14:56.749
(Search carefully!)

14:56.791 --> 14:57.439
(No sign of her here!)

14:57.481 --> 14:59.399
(My lady! My lady!)

14:59.441 --> 14:59.989
(No sign of her here!)

15:00.031 --> 15:03.869
(My lady! My lady!)

15:03.911 --> 15:04.530
(Have you checked over here?)

15:06.610 --> 15:07.749
(My lady! My lady!)

15:07.791 --> 15:08.980
(Check over there! Hurry!)

15:09.370 --> 15:11.439
(My lady! Is anyone there?)

15:11.481 --> 15:14.010
(My lady! My lady!)

15:14.100 --> 15:15.180
(My lady! Where are you?)

15:15.530 --> 15:15.989
(My lady!)

15:16.031 --> 15:17.010
(Have you searched this area?)

15:17.770 --> 15:18.460
(My lady!)

15:20.010 --> 15:21.180
(My lady!)

15:21.460 --> 15:22.319
(Check behind that tree!)

15:22.361 --> 15:23.300
(Try over there too!)

15:23.460 --> 15:23.890
(Got it!)

15:24.340 --> 15:30.199
(My lady! My lady!)

15:30.241 --> 15:31.100
(Has anyone checked over there?)

15:31.220 --> 15:31.829
(My lady!)

15:31.871 --> 15:33.439
(She couldn't have gone far!
She must be nearby!)

15:33.481 --> 15:34.610
(My lady!)

15:34.980 --> 15:37.010
(My lady! My lady!)

15:37.100 --> 15:38.980
(There's a path here! This way!)

15:39.300 --> 15:40.559
(My lady! My lady!)

15:40.601 --> 15:41.199
(Anyone there?)

15:41.241 --> 15:43.399
(My lady! My lady!)

15:43.441 --> 15:43.940
(Check over there!)

15:44.980 --> 15:46.060
(My lady!)

15:47.060 --> 15:51.820
(My lady! My lady!)

15:52.180 --> 15:52.850
(What about over here?)

15:53.340 --> 15:54.300
(My lady! No sign of her here!)

15:55.730 --> 15:56.490
(Let's search farther ahead!)

15:56.770 --> 15:59.300
(My lady! My lady!)

16:00.250 --> 16:06.340
(My lady! My lady!)

16:26.700 --> 16:27.130
Your Highness.

16:28.370 --> 16:29.300
The storm has passed.

16:35.460 --> 16:36.130
Shang's back!

16:36.820 --> 16:37.799
Why are you carrying someone?

16:37.841 --> 16:39.180
Brother, what happened?

16:39.370 --> 16:41.250
Xiaozhou, quick! Get your medical kit!

16:49.890 --> 16:51.220
Sleeping in your bed

16:52.370 --> 16:54.580
is much more comfortable
than lying in the woods.

17:08.980 --> 17:10.810
Brother, are you sure I can do this?

17:11.250 --> 17:13.460
I've only treated injured cows
and sheep for the villagers.

17:15.290 --> 17:16.530
And one dog.

17:17.220 --> 17:18.090
It was bitten by a leopard.

17:18.620 --> 17:20.380
Stopping bleeding and dressing wounds
work the same on people and animals.

17:21.140 --> 17:22.220
Everyone says you did a good job.

17:23.250 --> 17:24.010
Treat her wounds for now.

17:24.460 --> 17:25.530
I'll go into town for a physician

17:26.090 --> 17:27.250
and tell the authorities
we've found her.

17:28.090 --> 17:29.730
There's no need to fetch
a physician from town.

17:30.330 --> 17:31.050
I'm not going to die.

17:32.660 --> 17:34.250
If you dare bring the authorities
here again,

17:35.490 --> 17:36.770
I'll tear your house down!

17:37.570 --> 17:38.980
Xiaozhou, you handle this instead.

17:49.420 --> 17:50.860
My lady, you have quite a few wounds,

17:51.090 --> 17:52.220
but luckily, they're all superficial.

17:52.730 --> 17:53.620
With some ointment

17:53.700 --> 17:54.660
and a few doses of herbal medicine,

17:54.980 --> 17:55.810
you should recover.

18:10.530 --> 18:11.220
You've got the wrong hand.

18:11.380 --> 18:12.140
That's my hand.

18:13.010 --> 18:13.900
Exactly.

18:14.900 --> 18:15.530
Yan Shang.

18:16.770 --> 18:17.570
What are you doing?

18:22.460 --> 18:23.010
It's my fault.

18:29.250 --> 18:29.980
Don't you dare leave.

18:39.220 --> 18:39.660
I'm not leaving.

18:43.140 --> 18:43.570
Brother.

18:44.090 --> 18:45.119
My lady's still very weak.

18:45.161 --> 18:45.900
Stay with her for a while.

18:46.140 --> 18:46.660
I'll go brew the medicine.

18:47.380 --> 18:47.700
All right.

18:50.180 --> 18:51.010
Fang Tong and the others

18:52.220 --> 18:53.140
must still be looking for me.

18:54.140 --> 18:55.290
Let them know I'm here.

18:56.010 --> 18:56.330
Okay.

19:33.700 --> 19:34.620
I have no excuse, my lady!

19:34.700 --> 19:36.050
I failed to keep you safe!

19:36.570 --> 19:37.380
I thought...

19:38.090 --> 19:38.730
I thought...

19:38.860 --> 19:39.660
You thought

19:40.050 --> 19:41.380
I'd be left dead in the wilderness?

19:44.810 --> 19:45.490
Where's Chunhua?

19:46.050 --> 19:47.090
Why didn't she come back with you?

19:47.460 --> 19:48.460
Don't worry, my lady.

19:48.730 --> 19:49.490
Once she gets word,

19:49.770 --> 19:50.940
she'll come find us.

19:53.010 --> 19:53.730
Fang Tong.

19:54.490 --> 19:55.620
Has anyone ever told you

19:56.290 --> 19:57.860
you sound awful when you cry?

20:00.290 --> 20:00.810
Stop blubbering.

20:01.490 --> 20:02.180
Go get Yan Shang.

20:07.220 --> 20:07.810
I want to bathe.

20:08.810 --> 20:10.180
Your wounds haven't scabbed over yet.

20:10.380 --> 20:11.050
You can't soak them in water.

20:11.660 --> 20:12.460
You'll have to bear with it.

20:12.900 --> 20:14.140
Who said anything about soaking?

20:15.010 --> 20:16.010
I'm covered from head to toe

20:16.330 --> 20:18.090
in blood, sweat, and mud.

20:18.810 --> 20:19.900
I couldn't be any filthier.

20:20.220 --> 20:21.290
At least let me wash myself off.

20:21.860 --> 20:22.700
Go heat some water.

20:28.700 --> 20:30.460
My lady!

20:30.770 --> 20:32.530
What a terrible way to die!

20:33.250 --> 20:35.220
My lady!

20:37.220 --> 20:39.090
My lady!

20:39.570 --> 20:41.490
What a terrible way to die!

20:42.490 --> 20:45.220
How could you leave me all alone?

20:46.620 --> 20:50.660
Where am I supposed to go without you,
my lady?

20:51.570 --> 20:53.620
Please don't abandon me!

20:54.250 --> 20:55.900
My lady!

21:10.380 --> 21:11.220
What are you laughing at?

21:14.490 --> 21:15.330
Forgive me, miss.

21:16.290 --> 21:17.420
I didn't mean to laugh.

21:17.700 --> 21:18.180
It's just...

21:18.730 --> 21:19.490
Just what?

21:20.010 --> 21:20.420
It's just...

21:21.380 --> 21:22.220
There's something on your face...

21:26.330 --> 21:28.250
Are you scattering spirit money?

21:28.980 --> 21:30.140
Has an elder or relative passed away?

21:36.900 --> 21:37.860
Oh, please don't cry!

21:38.330 --> 21:39.010
I'm sorry.

21:39.490 --> 21:41.180
I shouldn't have brought up something
so painful.

21:42.660 --> 21:43.620
Not an elder.

21:44.530 --> 21:45.700
Nor a relative.

21:47.090 --> 21:49.090
It was my lady.

21:54.490 --> 21:55.050
Here, take this.

22:13.050 --> 22:15.570
My lady was still so young.

22:17.730 --> 22:19.090
She was such a good person.

22:19.620 --> 22:21.090
She'd already suffered so much.

22:21.770 --> 22:22.530
I never thought

22:23.730 --> 22:25.420
she'd lose her life like this.

22:26.980 --> 22:27.380
My condolences.

22:27.770 --> 22:28.180
My condolences.

22:29.010 --> 22:30.660
The others are still looking for her.

22:31.090 --> 22:33.050
I... I don't dare tell them.

22:34.140 --> 22:35.900
But if I send her spirit money too late,

22:36.220 --> 22:38.220
she'll have nothing for her journey.

22:38.900 --> 22:41.069
I can't let her arrive in the underworld

22:41.111 --> 22:42.490
without a penny to her name!

22:44.700 --> 22:46.140
My lady!

22:46.940 --> 22:48.570
Here's your money!

22:49.570 --> 22:52.140
Did you get it?

22:56.460 --> 22:57.330
Don't despair just yet.

22:57.940 --> 22:59.380
Your lady might still be alive.

23:00.220 --> 23:01.490
She might've jumped out
of the carriage herself.

23:05.330 --> 23:07.050
She fell from such a great height!

23:07.220 --> 23:08.660
And my lady can't even swim!

23:08.730 --> 23:10.250
How could she possibly have gotten away
on her own?

23:10.810 --> 23:11.140
Well...

23:13.140 --> 23:13.420
Then...

23:17.290 --> 23:18.460
I don't want to talk to you anymore!

23:18.730 --> 23:19.490
Where are you going?

23:19.770 --> 23:20.730
There's no path through those woods.

23:20.980 --> 23:21.860
I don't know you!

24:20.220 --> 24:20.660
Your Highness.

24:21.250 --> 24:21.860
The water's ready.

24:22.570 --> 24:23.900
I... I'll go get Xiaozhou.

24:24.140 --> 24:25.250
What do you need her for?

24:29.290 --> 24:30.290
Could she even carry me?

24:32.660 --> 24:33.730
What are you waiting for?

24:39.940 --> 24:40.620
Carry me over there.

24:46.250 --> 24:46.570
Carry you?

24:49.810 --> 24:50.980
What else?

24:52.460 --> 24:53.250
Do I look

24:53.460 --> 24:55.220
like I'm in any condition to walk?

25:31.570 --> 25:32.010
Stop right there.

25:40.290 --> 25:41.010
If you leave,

25:42.330 --> 25:43.620
who'll wait on me while I bathe?

26:03.530 --> 26:04.900
Miss, you're finally back!

26:05.980 --> 26:06.250
You...

26:06.980 --> 26:07.810
What are you doing here?

26:09.330 --> 26:10.980
That young man you were traveling with?

26:11.050 --> 26:11.810
He's gone back.

26:12.140 --> 26:12.980
He asked me to tell you

26:13.180 --> 26:13.860
to go find him.

26:14.250 --> 26:14.860
He's gone back?

26:15.980 --> 26:16.570
Back where?

26:16.940 --> 26:17.620
He said

26:18.660 --> 26:20.140
he'd gone back to
where he was staying before.

26:21.250 --> 26:22.330
Why would he go back to the Yan house?

26:24.290 --> 26:25.090
Miss! Miss!

26:25.530 --> 26:26.220
Stop following me!

26:29.490 --> 26:30.290
But, miss...

26:30.460 --> 26:31.660
I'm still waiting here.

26:35.940 --> 26:36.980
Miss, why are you back?

26:58.140 --> 26:58.490
Oh, no.

26:59.570 --> 27:00.490
Where was his house again?

27:02.620 --> 27:03.490
Are you lost, miss?

27:06.940 --> 27:07.460
Let me ask you something.

27:08.220 --> 27:10.460
Do you know a family named Yan
who lives in these mountains?

27:10.980 --> 27:12.460
Are you headed to the Yan residence,
my lady?

27:13.330 --> 27:14.090
You know them?

27:15.570 --> 27:16.220
Wonderful!

27:16.530 --> 27:18.140
Then hurry and tell me how to get there.

27:19.050 --> 27:19.940
What a coincidence!

27:20.180 --> 27:21.290
You probably won't believe this,

27:21.490 --> 27:22.420
but I'm headed to their house myself.

27:22.660 --> 27:23.420
We could go together.

27:34.700 --> 27:35.330
I don't believe you.

27:36.860 --> 27:38.010
You wouldn't be a swindler, would you?

27:39.460 --> 27:41.140
Or are you a kidnapper
trying to lure me away?

27:42.770 --> 27:43.090
I...

27:46.810 --> 27:47.620
I'm not a bad person.

28:00.300 --> 28:02.340
(Certificate of Examination Eligibility
Yingxiang 21, Feb. 2; Santu Magistrate)

28:04.980 --> 28:07.090
Certificate of Examination Eligibility.

28:09.490 --> 28:10.050
To tell you the truth, miss,

28:10.620 --> 28:11.420
I've passed the local qualifying exam.

28:11.770 --> 28:13.420
Soon I'll be heading to the capital
for the imperial exams.

28:13.770 --> 28:15.250
This certificate proves
I'm telling the truth.

28:15.940 --> 28:16.660
I'm a friend of Yan Shang's.

28:16.940 --> 28:17.660
I'm going to his house today

28:17.810 --> 28:19.050
to share the good news with him.

28:19.570 --> 28:20.250
You really know Yan...

28:38.980 --> 28:40.380
What's wrong, miss?

28:41.570 --> 28:43.770
I've been searching these mountains
for my lady for two days.

28:44.660 --> 28:45.730
My feet are covered in blood blisters.

28:50.730 --> 28:51.090
How about this?

28:52.010 --> 28:52.810
You can ride my horse.

28:53.770 --> 28:54.530
Then your feet won't hurt.

28:58.140 --> 28:59.570
But I've never ridden a horse before.

29:00.140 --> 29:01.330
Don't worry. I'll lead it for you.

29:21.330 --> 29:21.730
Forgive me.

29:30.250 --> 29:30.940
Hold on tight, miss.

29:53.220 --> 29:53.940
Try a different incense.

29:54.490 --> 29:55.330
I don't like this scent.

29:56.490 --> 29:56.860
Okay.

30:13.250 --> 30:13.810
I've changed it.

30:21.810 --> 30:22.660
The water's getting cold.

30:23.330 --> 30:23.770
Okay.

30:41.250 --> 30:43.180
Careful! Don't scald me.

30:45.860 --> 30:46.220
Of course.

31:00.330 --> 31:00.770
Just right.

31:06.420 --> 31:06.900
The bath powder.

31:09.090 --> 31:09.570
The bath powder.

31:48.480 --> 31:51.950
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft
and sweet♪

31:52.820 --> 31:55.960
♪Fireflies dance freely
through the night♪

31:57.110 --> 32:00.830
♪Chasing the beauty
of this fleeting world♪

32:01.340 --> 32:04.560
♪A thousand lights turn night into day♪

32:05.440 --> 32:08.940
♪Cicada songs mingle with the wine♪

32:09.850 --> 32:12.790
♪Their songs linger
through the passing years♪

32:14.185 --> 32:17.615
♪Life is but a fleeting stay♪

32:17.930 --> 32:21.580
♪How lucky I am to walk this path
with you♪

32:22.660 --> 32:26.050
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

32:27.620 --> 32:28.570
What happened?

32:29.620 --> 32:30.180
The wind picked up.

32:31.220 --> 32:34.540
♪I thought time might stand still♪

32:34.780 --> 32:38.720
♪Forever at that crossroads♪

32:42.180 --> 32:43.050
(This is fun!)

32:43.860 --> 32:44.860
(What am I, a tiger?)

32:45.250 --> 32:46.380
(You think I'm going to eat you?)

32:48.290 --> 32:49.050
(You're joking, Your Highness.)

32:50.570 --> 32:53.010
(My name is Mu Wanyao,
not Your Highness.)

32:53.940 --> 32:55.050
(Mu Wanyao?)

32:55.420 --> 32:56.660
(But I'm a princess.)

32:57.460 --> 32:58.530
(How could you address me
by my given name?)

33:00.250 --> 33:00.660
Xiaozhou.

33:00.980 --> 33:02.490
Why don't I go give Shang a hand?

33:03.980 --> 33:05.620
No, no!

33:06.420 --> 33:07.860
Father, let's go back inside.

33:09.770 --> 33:10.050
Come on.

33:10.490 --> 33:10.989
Father!

33:11.031 --> 33:11.490
Dalang!

33:12.290 --> 33:13.460
I've had more than enough of this sun.

33:13.770 --> 33:14.090
Let's go in!

33:14.770 --> 33:15.380
But Shang...

33:15.570 --> 33:16.010
- Brother.
- Hurry up!

33:20.090 --> 33:20.530
Slow down!

33:25.420 --> 33:27.010
Come back here! Get back here!

34:46.740 --> 34:47.050
This is the place.

34:48.260 --> 34:48.820
Thank you so much.

34:49.300 --> 34:50.780
I haven't even asked your name.

34:52.300 --> 34:53.490
I'm Liu Wenji.

34:53.940 --> 34:54.980
Liu Wenji. Thank you!

34:55.210 --> 34:55.780
I'm Chunhua.

34:57.610 --> 34:58.010
Chunhua.

35:00.650 --> 35:01.210
My lady's back!

35:04.570 --> 35:04.900
Oh!

35:08.490 --> 35:08.820
Careful!

35:42.210 --> 35:43.130
My lady!

35:45.690 --> 35:47.420
You're really alive!

35:48.980 --> 35:50.260
I'm not that easy to kill.

35:52.570 --> 35:53.340
You know that.

36:08.090 --> 36:08.570
My lady.

36:09.490 --> 36:10.490
We've only been apart a day,

36:11.300 --> 36:12.980
and you've already made Yan Shang
your male favorite?

36:13.260 --> 36:13.780
Chunhua.

36:14.090 --> 36:15.260
Do I look like that kind of woman?

36:15.780 --> 36:16.170
Yes...

36:19.650 --> 36:20.740
You've misunderstood, Miss Chunhua.

36:24.380 --> 36:25.570
If I were to take a male favorite,

36:26.210 --> 36:27.340
I'd be very particular.

36:47.050 --> 36:47.380
Shang!

36:48.380 --> 36:48.900
Wenji!

36:49.820 --> 36:50.490
What brings you here?

36:51.170 --> 36:51.460
Here!

36:54.170 --> 36:54.610
What's this?

37:04.620 --> 37:07.260
(Awarded First Place in the County's
Qualifying Examination)

37:13.090 --> 37:14.010
You came first!

37:15.740 --> 37:16.380
Wenji!

37:16.740 --> 37:17.690
Just as you predicted,

37:18.300 --> 37:19.610
you passed the local qualifying exam
with ease!

37:21.980 --> 37:22.300
Shang.

37:23.530 --> 37:24.420
Passing the local qualifying exam
is nothing.

37:25.210 --> 37:26.300
Neither is coming first.

37:26.980 --> 37:28.050
When I get to Sheng'an,

37:28.380 --> 37:29.650
I'll pass the imperial examination,

37:29.940 --> 37:30.860
become a marquis and chancellor,

37:31.170 --> 37:32.570
and accomplish something truly great!

37:35.650 --> 37:36.050
Wenji.

37:36.780 --> 37:37.690
I wouldn't say this about anyone else,

37:38.260 --> 37:38.940
but coming from you,

37:39.490 --> 37:40.530
I'm certain you'll achieve it.

37:42.690 --> 37:43.010
Shang.

37:43.650 --> 37:44.090
Rest assured.

37:44.460 --> 37:44.820
In the future,

37:45.170 --> 37:46.050
no matter when or where,

37:46.420 --> 37:47.130
I'll never forget you.

37:49.900 --> 37:50.340
Perhaps

37:50.690 --> 37:51.690
you could serve as my adviser.

37:52.010 --> 37:52.380
Then one day,

37:52.690 --> 37:53.900
we'll accomplish great things together!

38:07.170 --> 38:07.530
Shang.

38:09.610 --> 38:09.900
Come here.

38:11.170 --> 38:12.380
There's something else
I want to ask you.

38:13.380 --> 38:14.050
Earlier,

38:15.050 --> 38:16.610
that young woman was heading here too.

38:17.210 --> 38:17.820
Who is she?

38:21.610 --> 38:23.900
We've had a guest staying
with us these past few days.

38:24.650 --> 38:25.900
She's that guest's maid.

38:28.690 --> 38:29.460
She's a maid?

38:30.610 --> 38:31.090
That's right.

38:33.860 --> 38:34.300
Why?

38:37.940 --> 38:38.210
No...

38:38.690 --> 38:39.090
Nothing.

38:43.650 --> 38:44.260
Liu Wenji!

38:47.210 --> 38:47.900
Miss Chunhua.

38:50.420 --> 38:52.090
Liu Wenji, thanks for your kind words.

38:52.300 --> 38:53.530
My lady really is all right.

38:55.300 --> 38:55.860
What a shame.

38:56.260 --> 38:57.530
All that spirit money went to waste...

39:04.170 --> 39:04.980
What spirit money?

39:08.130 --> 39:09.300
Please don't bring that up.

39:11.780 --> 39:12.260
Liu Wenji.

39:12.860 --> 39:14.340
Just pretend you don't know.

39:15.340 --> 39:15.740
Please?

39:24.530 --> 39:25.860
Anyway, thank you.

39:29.260 --> 39:30.780
I need to fetch some things for my lady.

39:38.900 --> 39:39.260
Wenji.

39:41.130 --> 39:42.010
Why don't you stay for dinner?

39:43.690 --> 39:43.980
No.

39:44.300 --> 39:44.820
You see,

39:44.980 --> 39:47.130
my father's throwing a banquet
at our residence

39:47.460 --> 39:47.940
to celebrate my success.

39:48.380 --> 39:49.090
I'll visit another day.

39:50.740 --> 39:51.010
All right.

39:52.050 --> 39:52.530
I'll see you out.

40:12.780 --> 40:13.340
My lady.

40:14.170 --> 40:16.170
How much longer will you
need to recover?

40:20.460 --> 40:20.980
Chunhua.

40:21.860 --> 40:22.650
Do you like it here?

40:26.570 --> 40:27.530
Lingnan is terribly hot,

40:27.900 --> 40:28.740
and it rains all the time.

40:29.740 --> 40:31.210
The Yan family's house
is pretty run-down too.

40:31.490 --> 40:32.170
And there are bugs everywhere.

40:34.530 --> 40:35.090
But...

40:35.940 --> 40:37.090
the scenery is beautiful.

40:37.460 --> 40:38.380
It's peaceful here too,

40:38.690 --> 40:39.570
with hardly anyone around.

40:40.340 --> 40:42.460
You seem much happier here
than you ever did in the capital.

40:46.980 --> 40:48.210
There's really nothing good
about this place.

40:49.260 --> 40:50.260
My wounds have already healed enough.

40:51.050 --> 40:52.490
Yet I keep putting off leaving,

40:53.170 --> 40:54.490
lingering here day after day.

40:55.690 --> 40:56.690
It's nothing but cowardice.

40:58.010 --> 40:59.210
I'm only fooling myself.

41:00.300 --> 41:01.010
The truth is, I'm afraid,

41:01.860 --> 41:03.300
and I have no desire
to return to Sheng'an.

41:04.570 --> 41:05.050
My lady.

41:06.260 --> 41:07.530
Can't we just stay away?

41:10.610 --> 41:11.340
Do you think hiding here

41:12.340 --> 41:13.260
will keep us safe?

41:14.690 --> 41:15.570
The whole realm

41:16.460 --> 41:17.650
has long since slipped
from the throne's control.

41:18.780 --> 41:19.650
Hiding in Lingnan

41:20.050 --> 41:21.010
or hiding in Sheng'an

41:21.380 --> 41:22.090
makes no difference.

41:23.900 --> 41:24.980
We can hide for a while,

41:25.490 --> 41:26.420
but not forever.

41:28.490 --> 41:29.690
Sooner or later, we must return.

41:36.820 --> 41:37.780
Go fetch Yan Shang.

41:43.490 --> 41:43.940
My lady.

41:44.610 --> 41:45.130
It's late.

41:45.780 --> 41:46.530
Is something the matter?

41:49.090 --> 41:50.340
That day in the cave,

41:51.260 --> 41:52.650
some officers searching
for me passed by.

41:53.820 --> 41:54.940
I know you heard them.

41:56.300 --> 41:57.090
Why didn't you call out?

42:02.130 --> 42:03.010
You were already awake then?

42:03.210 --> 42:03.740
I was.

42:05.130 --> 42:06.900
But I was aching all over.

42:07.900 --> 42:08.740
I didn't feel like speaking

42:08.980 --> 42:09.610
or even moving.

42:11.300 --> 42:12.380
But I didn't expect

42:13.420 --> 42:14.610
you to stay perfectly still either.

42:21.740 --> 42:23.210
Because I didn't want them
to take you away.

42:24.490 --> 42:24.980
Why not?

42:27.170 --> 42:28.050
I'm no gentleman.

42:29.210 --> 42:29.650
There's something

42:30.610 --> 42:31.210
I want from you.

42:34.130 --> 42:35.130
You hid me from them,

42:35.300 --> 42:36.010
saved my life,

42:36.460 --> 42:37.340
brought me home,

42:37.820 --> 42:38.780
and nursed me back to health,

42:39.300 --> 42:40.530
all so I'd feel indebted to you.

42:41.380 --> 42:42.900
You hoped I might give you a chance

42:43.650 --> 42:45.170
to ride on my coattails

42:46.090 --> 42:47.340
and hitch a ride to Sheng'an.

42:48.900 --> 42:50.650
That night, when you argued
with your father,

42:51.210 --> 42:52.130
I heard everything.

43:01.010 --> 43:01.690
That's true.

43:04.900 --> 43:05.340
I'm sorry.

43:07.570 --> 43:08.460
Why apologize?

43:09.340 --> 43:09.780
Yan Shang.

43:10.490 --> 43:11.530
You did save my life.

43:12.820 --> 43:13.740
But my life

43:16.170 --> 43:17.380
isn't worth much to begin with.

43:25.530 --> 43:26.610
You put yourself in danger,

43:27.340 --> 43:28.300
ventured into the woods at night,

43:28.940 --> 43:30.210
and went to all that trouble.

43:30.820 --> 43:31.820
All for nothing.

43:36.740 --> 43:37.530
However,

43:37.900 --> 43:39.300
I'm feeling generous.

43:40.090 --> 43:41.460
I'm willing to give you another chance.

43:41.820 --> 43:43.740
You've served me well these past
few days.

43:44.210 --> 43:44.940
I'm quite pleased.

43:46.570 --> 43:48.610
Before I recover and take my leave,

43:49.420 --> 43:50.010
if you

43:50.570 --> 43:51.610
manage to please me,

43:52.780 --> 43:53.650
then I'll...

43:58.570 --> 43:59.820
I'll take you back with me.

44:03.500 --> 44:07.900
(Next Episode Preview)

44:08.570 --> 44:09.170
(Yan Shang.)

44:09.300 --> 44:10.340
(If you dare repeat)

44:10.460 --> 44:12.050
(a word of what I said today
to anyone else,)

44:12.210 --> 44:13.980
(I'll rip out your tendons
and skin you alive!)

44:16.210 --> 44:17.260
(Greetings, Lord Yu.)

44:17.860 --> 44:18.650
(Greetings, Father.)

44:19.090 --> 44:19.980
(Danyang has returned!)

44:24.241 --> 44:27.534
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:30.219 --> 44:35.135
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:37.329 --> 44:43.174
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

44:43.674 --> 44:48.900
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

44:51.669 --> 44:56.460
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44:57.296 --> 45:03.375
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:05.176 --> 45:08.326
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:08.326 --> 45:09.974
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:10.026 --> 45:13.750
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:14.128 --> 45:18.794
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:19.413 --> 45:23.454
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:23.945 --> 45:26.060
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:26.100 --> 45:33.046
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:33.809 --> 45:37.262
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:37.442 --> 45:40.587
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

45:41.026 --> 45:47.663
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

45:48.060 --> 45:52.574
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:52.612 --> 45:55.081
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:55.285 --> 46:02.172
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:02.484 --> 46:05.755
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:06.060 --> 46:09.233
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:09.557 --> 46:12.983
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:13.216 --> 46:16.441
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:16.772 --> 46:23.568
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:23.937 --> 46:28.503
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:28.550 --> 46:30.888
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:31.119 --> 46:37.954
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:38.303 --> 46:39.921
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:40.051 --> 46:41.847
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

46:42.204 --> 46:45.221
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:45.261 --> 46:46.588
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
